---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us">
    <div class="w-full max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-lg py-5xl">
        <h1 class="text-display-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-md">About Us</h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
            <p class="text-body-lg text-body mb-xl">
                Welcome to <strong>TF Aadhaar Cropper</strong>, your most trusted and secure utility tool for processing Aadhaar Cards.
            </p>
            
            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-sm">Our Mission</h2>
            <p class="text-body-md text-body mb-md">
                Our mission is to simplify the process of formatting and printing Aadhaar cards for individuals and businesses (like CSC centers). We strive to provide a fast, secure, and fully browser-based solution that respects user privacy and data security.
            </p>
            
            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-sm">Why Choose Us?</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-md text-body-md text-body mb-md space-y-xs">
                <li><strong>100% Secure:</strong> Your Aadhaar PDF or image is processed entirely within your browser. No data is ever uploaded to our servers.</li>
                <li><strong>Fast & Easy:</strong> Automatically detects boundaries and provides 1-click crop and print options.</li>
                <li><strong>Multiple Formats:</strong> Download in PNG, JPG, or PDF (Original / A4 Size).</li>
                <li><strong>Password Support:</strong> Easily unlock e-Aadhaar PDFs with built-in decryption handling.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-sm">About The Developer</h2>
            <p class="text-body-md text-body mb-md">
                TF Aadhaar Cropper is a project under <strong>Techily Fly</strong>, developed by <strong>AbdurRahman</strong>. We are committed to building high-quality, accessible tools for the Indian demographic.
            </p>
            
            <div class="card-marketing mt-2xl bg-canvas-soft">
                <h3 class="text-body-md-strong text-ink mb-xs">Contact Details</h3>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-body"><strong>Email:</strong> support@techilyfly.com</p>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-body"><strong>Phone:</strong> +918825164657</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
